{"blocks":[{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"こんばんは～"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"最近思うことはあーはやく18歳になりたいよー\nってことです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"17歳と18歳の差が大きすぎて泣けます。\nなんでこんなにも違うんだろう。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"18はおとな扱いなのにな～"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHHAZMA2SCCWX83XPX6T3SKH","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ナナなんと\n平手と2人で『週刊ヤングマガジン』さんの\n表紙をさせていただきました!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"とても驚きです。光栄です!嬉しい気持ちでいっぱいです(´｡･_･｡`)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"本当にありがとうございます。\nぜひご覧ください!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"『BRODY』さんでてちねるの連載が始まりました(´;ω;`)♡︎♡︎ありがとうございます。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"平手は武道を\n私は芸事を学びます!\n初回は、平手は空手。私は茶道を学びました!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"はじめて、撮影でお着物を着ましたヽ(〃v〃)ﾉ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"よーし、\n和を勉強するぞー!すっごく楽しみでワクワクしてます。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHHAZNE0QCH2SPH4TNF13XK4","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ぜひご覧ください!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"それから、ドラマのオフショットです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"5話の『裁判シタイ』でみんなが私を囲んで模写するところがあったのですが、みんなの書いた私が凄まじかったです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"佑唯ちゃん"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHHAZPCNC88QFFWND69HTSMY","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"これなに(笑)これだけでずっと笑ってました。(もちろん一生懸命書いてくれてました。ありがとな〜)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"それも裏に書きかけで止めたやつも書いてあったんですが、それがこちら。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHHAZQC6VAF4CJPAHYERGQMZ","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"(笑)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ここから書き始めたん(笑)フォルムから入るタイプでびっくりしました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"おだなな"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHHAZRD5B9ERZG77ZZ1WHJCQ","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"似てるけど、なんか猿人感。悪意はないんだろうけどな〜(笑)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そんな中、女神がいました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHHAZSCC9500AJ6TJF6QVBS8","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そうです、小池みーちゃんです。さすがです。(5分くらいで書いたらしい)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"美化してくだはった、( ˶ˆ꒳ˆ˵ )"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みんな、映らないのにちゃんと書いてくれて嬉しかったです。すっごく楽しい撮影でした!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ブログお読みいただきありがとうございます。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"長濱ねる"}],"source":"archive"}